<title>USA: Abercrombie IPO priced at $16/shr.</title>
<headline>Abercrombie IPO priced at $16/shr.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Abercrombie &amp; Fitch Co's initial public offer of seven million shares is priced at $16 a share, said underwriter Goldman Sachs and Co.</p>
<p>Abercrombie, a unit of Limited Inc, will offer 5.6 million shares in the U.S. and 1.4 million shares overseas, Goldman said.</p>
</text>
